# Code Conventions

- Functional components only. No class components.
- Named exports for components, default export at file bottom if needed.
- Keep components focused — one job per component.
- Animation logic lives in custom hooks or separate animation files, not inline in JSX.
- No magic numbers — use CSS custom properties or named constants for values that repeat.
- Prefer readability over cleverness. I need to understand this code in 3 months.
- Don't install new dependencies without flagging it. Ask first if unsure.

